<#ffcd3c>SPIN GAUGE / GOLDEN SPIN</>
Golden Spin (spin gauge full)		^X
  Hits fill the spin gauge (bottom of the screen): normals
  a little, a throw a lot, steel ball and special hits the
  most, super hits a little each. At full, X on the ground
  starts Golden Spin for 11 seconds: +30% damage, the ACT2
  moves are open even at ACT1, and the nail ammo never runs
  out. The bar shows the time left, then the gauge is empty.
  Also cancels a normal on contact.
Herb Tea (ACT2 and up)		_D^X
  For 5 seconds regenerates life and meter, reloads nails
  faster and refills his guard gauge.

<#ffcd3c>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him
  open.
Grab		^Y
  Hold back for the back throw.
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on him passes 15% of his life.
Puttsun Cancel (1 bar, in a special's recovery)		^A_+^B
  Cancels the special into neutral.
Dash		_F_F
Back Dash		_B_B
High Jump		_D_U
Taunt		START

<#ffcd3c>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
  Crouching Heavy fires a bullet.
Air Normals		^A / ^B / ^C
Run Attack (leaps ahead)		_F^C
Retreat Step		_B^C
Missed Shot (ACT2 and up, nail ammo)		_F^B

<#ffcd3c>SPECIALS</>
  The C version is the EX (500 meter). Without 500 meter
  it does not come out.
Fang (ACT1)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Spin Claw (ACT1)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Golden Spin (ACT2 and up, nail ammo)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Moving Hole (ACT2 and up, nail ammo)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Spinning Claw (invincible start)		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
New Road (ACT3 and up, nail ammo)		_B_D_DB^A / ^B / ^C
Shoot Myself (ACT3 and up)		_D_D^A
Killer's Eye grab (ACT3 and up)		_D_D^B
I Can See (ACT3 and up)		_D_D^C
Chumimin (ACT4, nail ammo)		_D_F^X / _D_B^X

<#ffcd3c>SUPERS (the ACT ladder)</>
ACT2 Evolution (1 bar, ACT1)		_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Hole Evolution (1 bar, ACT1)		_D_DB_B^A_+^B
ACT3 Evolution (1 bar, ACT2)		_D_DF_F^A_+^B
  Any two of A/B/C work for the evolutions.
Iron Ball Sacrifice (2 bars, reaches ACT4)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^C
